WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.723
- [Woman] Have an interview
with your kittens.

00:00:01.723 --> 00:00:03.580
- Oh my God.

00:00:03.580 --> 00:00:04.590
How many are there?

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.160
So you have to ask me questions

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:07.173
whilst I'm...

00:00:07.339 --> 00:00:10.172
(excited squeaks)

00:00:10.226 --> 00:00:12.395
I love kittens.

00:00:12.395 --> 00:00:15.605
They're so distracting
and cute, come here.

00:00:15.605 --> 00:00:19.272
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:20.417 --> 00:00:22.010
Hey guys, it's Henry Golding here,

00:00:22.010 --> 00:00:23.603
from Crazy Rich Asians.

00:00:23.960 --> 00:00:25.223
Buzzfeed gave me kittens.

00:00:25.592 --> 00:00:27.528
(excited squeals)

00:00:27.528 --> 00:00:30.770
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:30.770 --> 00:00:31.803
A house for kittens.

00:00:32.030 --> 00:00:34.633
I think one of those
kitten cafes or a cat cafe.

00:00:35.260 --> 00:00:38.353
I have an obscene fascination with cats.

00:00:38.530 --> 00:00:39.830
It's kind of embarrassing.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:41.210
But they're so cute.

00:00:41.210 --> 00:00:42.400
This one's pretty cute.

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:46.010
Either that, or buying out
somewhere like Disneyland.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:47.160
I hate crowds.

00:00:47.160 --> 00:00:49.200
So just bringing family
and friends over there

00:00:49.200 --> 00:00:51.410
and having a good time
without having to cue

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:52.940
and then filling the entire place

00:00:52.940 --> 00:00:55.243
with cats and dogs and puppies.

00:00:55.416 --> 00:00:56.999
That'd be the best.

00:00:57.032 --> 00:00:59.829
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:00:59.829 --> 00:01:00.710
I'm gonna say Jimmy O. Yang

00:01:00.710 --> 00:01:03.623
plays Bernard Tai extremely well.

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:07.560
The obnoxious cousin with
ridiculous amounts of money.

00:01:07.560 --> 00:01:08.490
That would be a fun role.

00:01:08.490 --> 00:01:10.933
If not, Awkwafina kills it as Peik Lin.

00:01:11.020 --> 00:01:12.610
That would've been a wicked role.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:14.310
I don't know about the wig though.

00:01:14.480 --> 00:01:15.923
That looks pretty itchy.

00:01:16.440 --> 00:01:17.913
Nobody wants to play with me.

00:01:19.030 --> 00:01:19.863
I gotcha.

00:01:20.408 --> 00:01:21.408
There we go.

00:01:23.132 --> 00:01:24.215
Hello, hello.

00:01:24.535 --> 00:01:28.202
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:01:28.380 --> 00:01:31.210
Oh man, I think I was like,
I must've been about four.

00:01:31.210 --> 00:01:33.590
I've got photos where I was very young,

00:01:33.590 --> 00:01:35.880
sort of just holding tight to cats.

00:01:35.880 --> 00:01:37.680
And actually, one of those photos

00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:40.780
I put up on Instagram and
it got me a movie role.

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.295
This is bringing back memories.

00:01:42.295 --> 00:01:45.495
(playful instrumental music)

00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:46.770
They're all leaving me.

00:01:48.935 --> 00:01:51.518
(woman laughs)

00:01:52.080 --> 00:01:54.063
This isn't how it's meant to go, guys.

00:01:54.190 --> 00:01:55.023
Here we go.

00:01:55.440 --> 00:01:56.683
See what's on there.

00:01:57.556 --> 00:01:58.389
I got you.

00:01:59.524 --> 00:02:00.691
No escape now.

00:02:03.490 --> 00:02:06.780
John scoured pretty much the entire world

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:09.590
for asian acting men.

00:02:09.590 --> 00:02:11.153
When I got the news,

00:02:11.510 --> 00:02:15.180
I was having this furious
fight on Valentine's Day

00:02:15.240 --> 00:02:16.140
with my wife.

00:02:16.140 --> 00:02:18.263
I get the call, it's John,

00:02:18.380 --> 00:02:19.413
everything stopped.

00:02:19.570 --> 00:02:20.790
And he told me the great news.

00:02:20.790 --> 00:02:23.821
And obviously the rest of
the day went really well.

00:02:23.821 --> 00:02:27.085
(playful instrumental music)

00:02:27.085 --> 00:02:29.398
I think it was just
that family camaraderie.

00:02:29.398 --> 00:02:31.640
We were such a tight-knit group.

00:02:31.640 --> 00:02:33.910
Every single night we'd go out for dinner,

00:02:33.910 --> 00:02:38.230
we'd hang out, I'd show
'em around KL or Singapore,

00:02:38.230 --> 00:02:39.400
and we were all there together.

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:42.250
Asians from America, from the UK,

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.980
from Australia, from
Malaysia and Singapore,

00:02:44.980 --> 00:02:46.080
it was really special.

00:02:46.589 --> 00:02:48.293
Like these kittens.

00:02:48.753 --> 00:02:50.437
Oh, this one's so fluffy.

00:02:50.437 --> 00:02:51.270
So fluffy.

00:02:54.740 --> 00:02:56.393
Well, you missed Michelle Yeoh.

00:02:56.720 --> 00:03:01.257
Michelle Yeoh is the biggest, amazing,

00:03:01.257 --> 00:03:03.300
female asian star in the universe.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.670
She was queen on and off the set.

00:03:05.670 --> 00:03:08.530
So classy, so down to earth,

00:03:08.530 --> 00:03:11.130
every morning she'd come on set,

00:03:11.130 --> 00:03:14.190
she'd like hug everyone from
the grips, the lighting,

00:03:14.190 --> 00:03:17.443
to the B actors, to all the ADs

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:19.967
that's exactly how you want
a movie star to act like.

00:03:19.967 --> 00:03:23.021
She was priceless, I love her to bits.

00:03:23.021 --> 00:03:26.771
(playful instrumental music)

00:03:26.828 --> 00:03:29.770
I think John Cho has been
killing it when it comes

00:03:29.770 --> 00:03:34.760
to being sort of Asian
leading man in a lot of films.

00:03:34.760 --> 00:03:36.710
Like he's producing his own movies,

00:03:36.710 --> 00:03:38.263
telling his own stories.

00:03:38.370 --> 00:03:39.203
Ang Lee.

00:03:39.230 --> 00:03:41.063
He is like amazing.

00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:44.283
So I think doing a film with
Ang Lee would be breathtaking.

00:03:46.120 --> 00:03:47.970
They're having so much fun behind me.

00:03:48.094 --> 00:03:49.323
(laughs)

00:03:49.323 --> 00:03:50.740
Have fun in here.

00:03:50.947 --> 00:03:52.197
You're so cute.

00:03:52.986 --> 00:03:53.819
Oh, hello.

00:03:54.450 --> 00:03:58.890
I've coached him into being my friend.

00:03:58.890 --> 00:04:00.440
Don't leave, no don't leave me.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:02.633
Oh, okay.

00:04:03.150 --> 00:04:06.017
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:04:06.017 --> 00:04:07.350
You know, in the core of it,

00:04:07.350 --> 00:04:10.150
like Nick is a really well traveled guy,

00:04:10.150 --> 00:04:14.133
he puts family and love
first before family riches,

00:04:14.380 --> 00:04:16.380
and I think he just wants
to do the right thing.

00:04:16.380 --> 00:04:18.420
He sees the error of his ways

00:04:18.420 --> 00:04:21.267
and tries to make amends with Rachel.

00:04:21.267 --> 00:04:23.723
I just got a kitten butt in my face.

00:04:23.770 --> 00:04:26.300
It was a little silly
in not preparing Rachel.

00:04:26.300 --> 00:04:27.720
Maybe he was afraid that something...

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.320
Look, this guy's trying to escape.

00:04:29.320 --> 00:04:30.153
Don't do it.

00:04:30.581 --> 00:04:31.414
Come back.

00:04:31.898 --> 00:04:34.957
He wants to be independent
and not have to rely

00:04:35.110 --> 00:04:38.233
on being their heir to this
ridiculous family throne.

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:39.963
I guess we have that in common.

00:04:40.230 --> 00:04:41.610
I definitely don't have the bank account.

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:44.603
Like, I wish that was something
perhaps was available.

00:04:44.698 --> 00:04:48.365
(upbeat instrumental music)

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:50.650
I don't believe in having regrets.

00:04:50.650 --> 00:04:52.610
Just think of it as a learning process.

00:04:52.610 --> 00:04:54.130
I've never let anything get me down.

00:04:54.130 --> 00:04:56.600
Otherwise you're just
gonna have bad vibes,

00:04:56.600 --> 00:04:57.493
negative energy.

00:04:57.670 --> 00:04:58.503
Let it go.

00:04:59.230 --> 00:05:00.930
Be like a kid and forget about it.

00:05:01.018 --> 00:05:01.851
Oh.

00:05:02.186 --> 00:05:04.530
So if you guys are interested in adopting

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:06.500
any of these really cute kittens,

00:05:06.500 --> 00:05:09.080
please go to Best Friends Animal Society

00:05:09.080 --> 00:05:10.833
and that's bestfriends.org.

00:05:11.098 --> 00:05:12.157
They're all up for adoption.

00:05:12.157 --> 00:05:13.313
Adopt, don't shop.

00:05:13.641 --> 00:05:15.973
(lips smack)

00:05:15.973 --> 00:05:17.373
Alright, alright, stay here.

00:05:18.186 --> 00:05:21.853
(upbeat instrumental music)

